# The three files below are byte-pinned by data/scenarios/manifest.json, whose
# digests are computed over raw file bytes. Pin LF so a clean checkout on Linux,
# macOS and Windows all produce byte-identical files: with core.autocrlf a
# Windows checkout turned them into CRLF and the hash check failed on CI.
# Scoped to the manifest-pinned files only, so unrelated fixtures keep their
# current bytes and the diff stays reviewable.
data/scenarios/manifest.json text eol=lf
data/scenarios/tiny_master.json text eol=lf
data/scenarios/coldchain_chain_10.json text eol=lf
